ClaimUnstake_Lido_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── given vault does not own the requestId
│  └── it should revert in the queue on transferFrom
├── given vault has not setApprovalForAll on the queue
│  └── it should revert in the queue on transferFrom
└── given vault owns and has approved adapter
   ├── given request not yet finalized
   │  └── it should revert with NotFinalized
   └── given request finalized
      ├── it should pull NFT from vault
      ├── it should claim ETH from queue to adapter
      ├── it should wrap ETH to WETH
      ├── it should forward WETH to vault
      ├── it should burn the NFT
      └── it should leave zero ETH and zero WETH in adapter
